      "notes": [
        "The Acceptance and Work sequence and evidence sections of .engineering/planning/story/kubernetes-spec-service.md own the outcome. Select and record the current main baseline before implementation. Historical 801b8d5 checks remain evidence of that revision; do not reset the source to it. Reuse verified checks only for unchanged exact inputs and obtain any missing baseline/image proof before extending Kubernetes generation and packaging.",
        "Resolve the current crates/connectors-spec/toolchain.json through the repository's exact-source receipt checks. At integration the pin is 6f7ef46163e758f3401945d1a946e0fc80ebc003. Do not restore the old release pin, downgrade global tools or repeat the already-completed GitLab migration.",
        "Preserve resources.list for pods, services, deployments and EndpointSlices, endpoints.discover and configuration-gated hosts.discover. Pin upstream bytes and retain namespace/kind admission, cursor binding, completeness, provenance and explicit missing-semantics refusals. Resolve the existing generation mapping limitation before implementing selection.",
        "Follow current shared and adapter-owned ESS declarations. Model and validate any necessary typed extension first. Keep provider semantics in the adapter and preserve GitLab generation plus SQL behavior. Reuse the Rust executor for exact-image packaging and direct/federated three-adapter acceptance.",
        "Follow AGENTS.md for bot-authored commits, verified authority, managed checkouts and leases, two Cargo jobs and task-owned TMPDIR. Keep credentials out of source and evidence. Use connectors for integrations and report gaps before alternative clients. Retain evidence and clean only owned fixtures.",
        "This draft authorizes no paid launch by itself. Recheck current protocol loading and let the driver select its map. A selected run needs operator budget-usd and assume-usd-per-run plus pause-on-approval. Relay refusals. Run applicable local gates for changed implementation; do not duplicate already-passing unchanged gates remotely.",
        "Keep this outcome local: no external publication, Atlas enrollment, consumer rollout, other providers, writes, watches, automatic discovery activation or changes to sibling AEP, ESS or original Connectors repositories."
      ]
    },
    "artifacts": {
      "derived_from": [
        "story:kubernetes-spec-service"
      ]
    }
  },
  "protocol": {
